{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28262","headline":"雪中书怀 · 杜牧","name":"雪中书怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腊雪一尺厚，云冻寒顽痴。\n孤城大泽畔，人疎烟火微。\n愤悱欲谁语，忧愠不能持。\n天子号仁圣，任贤如事师。\n凡称曰治具，小大无不施。\n明庭开广敞，才隽受羁维。\n如日月縆昇，若鸾凤葳蕤。\n人才自朽下，弃去亦其宜。\n北虏坏亭障，闻屯千里师。\n牵连久不解，他盗恐旁窥。\n臣实有长策，彼可徐鞭笞。\n如蒙一召议，食肉寝其皮。\n斯乃庙堂事，尔微非尔知。\n向来躐等语，长作陷身机。\n行当腊欲破，酒齐不可迟。\n且想春候暖，瓮间倾一巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}